.env
.claude/

# Fetched + derived data (regenerable from the APIs; large).
# data/sample/ is committed so a fresh clone has something real to open
# without an API key and hours of downloading.
#
# NOTE: this must be `data/*`, not `data/`. Git does not descend into an
# excluded DIRECTORY, so a later `!data/sample/` negation would never be
# reached and the sample would stay invisible.
data/*
!data/sample/

# Large exports dropped at the repo root
/dataset.csv

# Workflow scratch (task briefs, reports, review packages, progress ledger)
.superpowers/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
CLAUDE.md
/docs/superpowers